        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, PHI 0",
        "text": "Pavel Zacha scored his first of the season at 12:21 off a David Pastrnak backhand pass; his knuckling shot got a piece of Dan Vladar's left pad and trickled over the line."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 2, PHI 0",
        "text": "Boston outshot Philadelphia 19–3 over the first 30 minutes. After a Jeremy Swayman blocker save, the Bruins broke out 4-on-2 and Mason Lohrei beat Vladar over the shoulder at 17:12 for 2–0. Shots were 22–8 after two periods."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 5, PHI 1",
        "text": "Marat Khusnutdinov scored from point-blank range on Fraser Minten's feed from behind the net at 1:55 for 3–0. Porter Martone's power-play goal at 6:32 ended Swayman's shutout bid at 3–1, but Casey Mittelstadt redirected an Elias Lindholm pass at 9:21 for 4–1, and Minten finished a breakaway at 15:59 for 5–1."
      }
